Pywel Atlas combined v0.83 map markers (v0.83: Abyss Nexus markers turned off in the panel or with F10 are hidden with the game's own hide-reason function (bit 23) instead of removed, and shown again when turned on; read-only observation: layer settings of our icon types, hide bits of our world-map markers right after creation, Abyss Nexus hide-bit changes by name, 4 watched Nexus, 2 chest and 2 Abyss chest markers per round at 3 s / 10 s and on layer changes, with picture objects, container-list check and raw copies; markers on the world map and the minimap; surface Abyss Nexus markers (game icon type 234) until activated; minimap markers created with their own number and adopted once the game has built them; Greymane Shrine markers on, world map needs the Shrine Icons file mod; F8 lists icon types with a world-map look; game type 186/40/41 creations logged, our own markers left out of the sample list) - one native Bell icon (type 360) per not-completed Bell, one chest icon (type 226) per not-opened chest of the game's dedicated chest levels, caves/dungeons, puzzle strongboxes and house chests (190 chests; strongboxes from the save's field-object list, unknown ones hidden) and one chest icon (type 226) per not-opened Abyss chest (74, Abyss map layer) in the detected save, shown at every map zoom (zoom limit off on our own markers only); Greymane Shrine markers on (game shrine icon, type 186); up to 256 markers per category, checked 32 per map update; F10 hides all, F6 shows again. A failed marker is retried every 5 s without blocking others. Observation: zoom windows per icon type, map zoom on F8, player position from the minimap, world-create records (ours and the game's own shrine/Bell icons)
